From: T0biii <5702338+T0biii@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 14:51:35 +0100
Subject: patches: openwrt: backport mmc power-off-delay-us support

Backport the upstream Linux commit 3c6f98b6e64e ("mmc: core: Add
power-off-delay-us support", in Linux 7.4) to the OpenWrt kernel 6.12.
The commit makes the delay after an MMC power-off configurable per host
from the device tree. The default stays at 1 ms. The next patch sets
it for the NanoPi R2S.

Signed-off-by: T0biii <5702338+T0biii@users.noreply.github.com>
---
